---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { siteData } from '../data/siteData';

const lastUpdated = "October 2026";
---

<Layout
  title={`Privacy Policy & Client Data Protection | ${siteData.name}`}
  description="Official Privacy Policy and Data Handling Principles for Moazzam Shoukat's technical advisory, AI research collaborations, and immigration & English test coaching services."
>
  <div class="py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      
      <!-- Top Badge & Header -->
      <div class="mb-12">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400 border border-amber-500/20 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">
          TRANSPARENCY & DATA ETHICS
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-black text-[#0A1128] dark:text-white tracking-tight leading-[1.15]">
          Privacy Policy & <br />
          <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-600 via-amber-500 to-amber-600 dark:from-amber-400 dark:to-amber-200 bg-clip-text text-transparent">Client Data Protection.</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-4 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">
          Last Updated: {lastUpdated} &bull; Applicable to moazzamshoukat.com and related direct advisory channels.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Content Container -->
      <div class="space-y-10 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
        
        <!-- Section 1 -->
        <section class="p-8 rounded-3xl bg-white dark:bg-[#111827] border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 space-y-3 shadow-xs">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#0A1128] dark:text-white">
            1. Commitment to Confidentiality
          </h2>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
            I, Moazzam Shoukat, treat your personal, academic, and immigration data with strict confidentiality. Whether you contact me for Canada Express Entry advice, Australian Skilled Migration roadmaps, IELTS/PTE preparation, or AI research discussions, your details are held securely and never shared with commercial brokers, advertising networks, or unauthorized third parties.
          </p>
        </section>

        <!-- Section 2 -->
        <section class="p-8 rounded-3xl bg-white dark:bg-[#111827] border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 space-y-3 shadow-xs">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#0A1128] dark:text-white">
            2. Information We Collect
          </h2>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
            We only collect information voluntarily provided by you through our consultation request forms, email correspondence, or direct WhatsApp chats:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-xs sm:text-sm space-y-1.5 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 pt-1">
            <li><strong>Identification & Contact Data:</strong> Full name, email address, WhatsApp number, and country of residence.</li>
            <li><strong>Profile Assessment Data:</strong> Academic qualifications, degree majors, years of relevant work experience, and current English test band scores (IELTS/PTE).</li>
            <li><strong>Immigration & Study Goals:</strong> Target destination (Canada or Australia), visa subclass interests, and specific consulting objectives.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <!-- Section 3 -->
        <section class="p-8 rounded-3xl bg-white dark:bg-[#111827] border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 space-y-3 shadow-xs">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#0A1128] dark:text-white">
            3. How We Use Your Information
          </h2>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
            The data you submit is used solely to:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-xs sm:text-sm space-y-1.5 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 pt-1">
            <li>Evaluate your profile against Canadian CRS criteria, Australian GSM point tables, or skills assessment requirements.</li>
            <li>Schedule and deliver 1-on-1 tutoring sessions, mock speaking diagnostics, and feedback reports.</li>
            <li>Respond to direct questions submitted through our consultation contact channels.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <!-- Section 4 -->
        <section class="p-8 rounded-3xl bg-white dark:bg-[#111827] border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 space-y-3 shadow-xs">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#0A1128] dark:text-white">
            4. Local Storage & Cookies
          </h2>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
            This website does not run intrusive cross-site tracking cookies. We utilize browser <code>localStorage</code> purely to remember your preferred visual appearance theme (Dark Mode vs Light Mode) to prevent screen flickering upon subsequent page visits.
          </p>
        </section>

        <!-- Section 5 -->
        <section class="p-8 rounded-3xl bg-white dark:bg-[#111827] border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 space-y-3 shadow-xs">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#0A1128] dark:text-white">
            5. Professional Advisory Disclaimer
          </h2>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
            Information provided on this website, in blog articles, and during preliminary consultation sessions is intended for strategic planning, educational guidance, and score optimization. It does not constitute formal statutory legal advice. Visa grant criteria and immigration policies remain at the sole discretion of relevant sovereign immigration authorities (IRCC for Canada, and the Department of Home Affairs for Australia). Results may vary based on candidate commitment and verified credentials.
          </p>
        </section>

        <!-- Section 6 -->
        <section class="p-8 rounded-3xl bg-amber-500/5 dark:bg-amber-500/10 border border-amber-500/30 space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#0A1128] dark:text-white">
            6. Contact Regarding Data & Privacy
          </h2>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
            If you have questions regarding the data you shared, or wish to request the deletion of your consultation notes, contact Moazzam directly:
          </p>
          <div class="pt-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200 space-y-1">
            <p>Email: <a href="mailto:moazzamshoukat1@gmail.com" class="text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400 underline">moazzamshoukat1@gmail.com</a></p>
            <p>WhatsApp: <a href="https://wa.me/923280484399" class="text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400 underline">+92-328-048-4399</a></p>
            <p>Office / Location: Lahore, Punjab, Pakistan</p>
          </div>
        </section>

      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
